WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.223
Swift AI: Thanks for calling Sample Auto Workshop. I’m the AI receptionist. How can I help?

2
00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:11.133
Sample caller: Hi, I’d like a logbook service and a brake check next Tuesday.

3
00:00:11.473 --> 00:00:16.361
Swift AI: Certainly. What’s your name, and the car’s make, model and year?

4
00:00:16.661 --> 00:00:22.182
Sample caller: I’m Alex Morgan. It’s a twenty nineteen Toyota Corolla, with eighty thousand kilometres.

5
00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:28.608
Swift AI: What have you noticed with the brakes? Are any warning lights on, and what’s the registration?

6
00:00:28.908 --> 00:00:35.107
Sample caller: They squeak a little. No warning lights. The registration is D E M O, zero one.

7
00:00:35.447 --> 00:00:40.921
Swift AI: Thanks. What’s your full address, including suburb, and your callback number?

8
00:00:41.221 --> 00:00:49.071
Sample caller: Twelve Example Street, St Albans. My number is zero four nine one, five seven zero, zero zero six.

9
00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:57.420
Swift AI: That’s twelve Example Street, St Albans, and the number ending zero zero six. Have I got that right?

10
00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:03.530
Sample caller: Yes, that’s right. Could I drop the car off around eight on Tuesday? I can leave it with you.

11
00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:09.471
Swift AI: I’ll note that preference. Would you like a text once the workshop confirms a time?

12
00:01:09.771 --> 00:01:14.628
Sample caller: Yes, please. And could they let me know the estimated cost before starting?

13
00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:27.004
Swift AI: Of course. I’ll pass on the service, brake check and drop-off request. The team will confirm availability and pricing before booking. Thanks, Alex.
